  "title": "Air Fryer Popcorn Shrimp",
  "description": "These air fryer popcorn shrimp are super light and crispy. Leaving the tails on the shrimp makes them easy to handle, but feel free to remove them.",
  "authors": [
    "Soup Loving Nicole"
  ],
